    "offering_evidence": [
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001878848-25-000063",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001878848-25-000063-ed203100d6a86dad",
        "accession_number": "0001878848-25-000063",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-28",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Although we believe that our mining activities do not presently trigger these state licensing requirements in any state in which we operate or plan to operate, if our activities cause us to be deemed a “money transmitter,” “money services business” or equivalent designation under the law of any state in which we operate or plan to operate, we may be required to seek a license or register at the state level and comply with laws that may include the implementation of anti-money laundering programs, reporting and recordkeeping regimes, consumer protective safeguards and other operational requirements.",
        "start_character": 62278,
        "end_character": 62883
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001878848-25-000063",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001878848-25-000063-ed203100d6a86dad",
        "accession_number": "0001878848-25-000063",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-28",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As both the owner and operator of our hardware for Bitcoin mining and AI Cloud Services and data centers, we are directly incentivized to optimize each component of our value chain.",
        "start_character": 23515,
        "end_character": 23696
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001878848-25-000063",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001878848-25-000063-ed203100d6a86dad",
        "accession_number": "0001878848-25-000063",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As part of our diversification efforts into HPC and AI services, on February 12, 2025 we announced that we are developing an up to 50 MW IT load direct-to-chip liquid cooled data center at our Childress site in Texas known as “Horizon 1”, targeting energization by the end of calendar year 2025.",
        "start_character": 20977,
        "end_character": 21272
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001878848-25-000063",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001878848-25-000063-ed203100d6a86dad",
        "accession_number": "0001878848-25-000063",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we are developing our 1,400MW Sweetwater 1 and 600MW Sweetwater 2 projects, including designing a direct fiber loop between the two sites to potentially create a 2GW data center hub for HPC and AI services.",
        "start_character": 38209,
        "end_character": 38428
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001878848-25-000063",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001878848-25-000063-ed203100d6a86dad",
        "accession_number": "0001878848-25-000063",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-28",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our focus on developing and offering HPC and AI services may impact our energy strategy including limiting our ability to curtail energy use and require a different strategy for hedging in the electricity markets in which we operate.",
        "start_character": 34704,
        "end_character": 34937
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001878848-25-000063",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001878848-25-000063-ed203100d6a86dad",
        "accession_number": "0001878848-25-000063",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Pursuant to that strategy, we continue to acquire hardware and develop our sites to support the growth of the AI Cloud Services business, when we believe there is potential demand from customers to support such activities.",
        "start_character": 37188,
        "end_character": 37410
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001878848-25-000063",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001878848-25-000063-ed203100d6a86dad",
        "accession_number": "0001878848-25-000063",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also focus on grid-connected power access which we believe not only helps facilitate a more reliable, long-term supply of power, but also provides us with the ability to support the energy markets in which we operate (for example, through potential participation in demand response, ancillary services provision and load management in deregulated markets such as Texas).",
        "start_character": 2945,
        "end_character": 3318
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001878848-25-000063",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001878848-25-000063-ed203100d6a86dad",
        "accession_number": "0001878848-25-000063",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-28",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are a vertically integrated business, and currently own and operate our computing hardware (consisting of Bitcoin mining ASICs and AI Cloud Services GPUs) as well as our electrical infrastructure and data centers.",
        "start_character": 1772,
        "end_character": 1988
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001878848-25-000063",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001878848-25-000063-ed203100d6a86dad",
        "accession_number": "0001878848-25-000063",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are continuing to develop our HPC and AI services products and services to further expand and diversify our customer relationships and revenue streams.",
        "start_character": 21522,
        "end_character": 21676
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001878848-25-000063",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001878848-25-000063-ed203100d6a86dad",
        "accession_number": "0001878848-25-000063",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-28",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are unable to predict the effect that any future regulatory change, or any overlapping or unclear regulations, may have on us, but such change, overlap or lack of clarity could be substantial and make it difficult for us to operate our business or materially impact the market for digital assets that we mine or may mine in the future.",
        "start_character": 64461,
        "end_character": 64799
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001878848-25-000063",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001878848-25-000063-ed203100d6a86dad",
        "accession_number": "0001878848-25-000063",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-28",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We currently use Antpool and Foundry as our main mining pool service providers and we are subject to Antpool’s User Service Agreement and Foundry's Pool Terms.",
        "start_character": 11898,
        "end_character": 12057
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001878848-25-000063",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001878848-25-000063-ed203100d6a86dad",
        "accession_number": "0001878848-25-000063",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-28",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Establishing a social license in the regions in which we operate is a core focus.",
